 * Code.gs — PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZED VERSION
 *
 * PDF GENERATION RULES (do NOT change):
 *  1) submitFormAndCreatePDF  → PDF banata hai SIRF current submission
 *                               se (i.e. form mein abhi bhare hue entries
 *                               se). INWARD se kuch bhi read NAHI hota
