 *                               NAHI aayega.
 *
 *  2) createChallanPDF        → PDF banata hai INWARD se, us dispatchId
 *                               ke SAARE rows (jitne bhi submissions huye
 *                               us ID pe). Yeh full reprint hai.
 *
 * Baaki sab logic same — batch writes, cache, lock, duplicate prevention
 * 100% preserved. Columns, mappings, IDs sab same.
 ************************************************************/

